<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sequent Computer raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sequent Computer raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial Group said analyst Gary Helmig raised Sequent Computer Systems Inc's short-term rating to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remains unchanged at hold.</p>
<p>-- Sequent gained 7/8 to 20 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
